{"schemaVersion":1,"spaceID":"9bf7e458-883e-41c8-aca0-0d9a89d2432a","content":[{"created":1777869223112.407,"isDeleted":false,"rootBlockId":"F3C54074-DD47-49EC-B720-9B5D0262D3AD","updated":1777869224126.802,"originalType":"DocumentDataModel","isInserted":false,"id":"CC35E3A9-2026-426C-A9CE-71F92FD5C564","isFetched":true,"modified":1777869223112.4092,"syncEnabled":true,"stamp":"8C010C32-A5FA-452B-A7BB-2C8F4D3C8138"},{"content":"---","pluginData":"","created":1777869223113.282,"style":"{\"_runAttributes\":[],\"alignmentStyle\":\"left\",\"decorationStyles\":{},\"decorations\":{},\"indentationLevel\":0,\"lineStyle\":\"regular\",\"listStyle\":\"none\",\"textStyle\":\"body\"}","rawProperties":"{}","modifiedByUserId":"a32da3dc-7552-ed01-a894-e2d81fe1d89c","createdByUserId":"a32da3dc-7552-ed01-a894-e2d81fe1d89c","originalType":"BlockDataModel","pageStyleProps":"{}","type":"line","isInserted":false,"pageStyleData":"","id":"9A3C2D0F-A79B-43B9-9896-85A3792F6063","updated":1777869223113.8259,"isFetched":true,"stamp":"0F8CF907-AB11-4E03-96D8-5C8621988CEC","blocks":[],"documentId":"CC35E3A9-2026-426C-A9CE-71F92FD5C564","isDeleted":false},{"isDeleted":false,"id":"3858672E-D604-425C-ADDA-8DE59DF1E5BF","rawProperties":"{}","documentId":"CC35E3A9-2026-426C-A9CE-71F92FD5C564","pageStyleProps":"{}","pluginData":"","updated":1777869223114.304,"isInserted":false,"content":"Designing an app with AppSheet is an iterative process [1] that generally follows a core framework to build, customize, and deploy your solution [2]. Here are the six primary steps every app creator should follow:","createdByUserId":"a32da3dc-7552-ed01-a894-e2d81fe1d89c","blocks":[],"modifiedByUserId":"a32da3dc-7552-ed01-a894-e2d81fe1d89c","pageStyleData":"","created":1777869223114.218,"type":"text","isFetched":true,"originalType":"BlockDataModel","stamp":"B6433B58-564F-4EFF-AC6A-53B6FECC5417","style":"{\"_runAttributes\":[{\"isBold\":true,\"isCode\":false,\"isItalic\":false,\"isStrikethrough\":false,\"range\":[0,30]},{\"isBold\":false,\"isCode\":false,\"isItalic\":false,\"isStrikethrough\":false,\"linkURL\":\"craftdocs:\\\/\\\/open?blockId=F3C54074-DD47-49EC-B720-9B5D0262D3AD&spaceId=9bf7e458-883e-41c8-aca0-0d9a89d2432a\",\"range\":[0,30]},{\"highlightColor\":\"#2449fe #61e5ff;#ca4ba7 #ff70f5;g\",\"isBold\":false,\"isCode\":false,\"isItalic\":false,\"isStrikethrough\":false,\"range\":[0,30]}],\"decorationStyles\":{},\"decorations\":{},\"indentationLevel\":0,\"listStyle\":\"none\",\"textStyle\":\"body\"}"},{"style":"{\"_runAttributes\":[{\"isBold\":true,\"isCode\":false,\"isItalic\":false,\"isStrikethrough\":false,\"range\":[90,8]},{\"isBold\":true,\"isCode\":false,\"isItalic\":false,\"isStrikethrough\":false,\"range\":[177,10]}],\"decorationStyles\":{},\"decorations\":{},\"indentationLevel\":0,\"listStyle\":\"none\",\"textStyle\":\"body\"}","id":"6B94F247-333C-46A4-84C9-EE41DF55451D","pluginData":"","isFetched":true,"createdByUserId":"a32da3dc-7552-ed01-a894-e2d81fe1d89c","type":"text","created":1777869223114.9148,"originalType":"BlockDataModel","documentId":"CC35E3A9-2026-426C-A9CE-71F92FD5C564","content":"\nAppSheet apps are fundamentally driven by data. You must first categorize your data into entities (representing real-world things like employees, jobs, or customers) and their properties (details like names, addresses, or phone numbers) [3, 4]. Every instance of an entity shares the same properties but holds unique values, and you must also define how these entities are related to one another [4, 5].","updated":1777869223114.9558,"isInserted":false,"blocks":[],"isDeleted":false,"pageStyleProps":"{}","stamp":"4D0EB99B-BAE6-4354-9540-CBBABFEE8B10","modifiedByUserId":"a32da3dc-7552-ed01-a894-e2d81fe1d89c","pageStyleData":"","rawProperties":"{}"},{"blocks":["6B94F247-333C-46A4-84C9-EE41DF55451D"],"documentId":"CC35E3A9-2026-426C-A9CE-71F92FD5C564","id":"B4F98D8D-02F3-4BCB-87A2-F10C96595213","rawProperties":"{\"hasBeenPagifiedBefore\":\"1\"}","updated":1777869223115.3081,"content":"1. Define your entities","created":1777869223115.1089,"type":"text","pageStyleData":"","originalType":"BlockDataModel","isFetched":true,"createdByUserId":"a32da3dc-7552-ed01-a894-e2d81fe1d89c","modifiedByUserId":"a32da3dc-7552-ed01-a894-e2d81fe1d89c","isDeleted":false,"pageStyleProps":"{}","isInserted":false,"style":"{\"_runAttributes\":[{\"isBold\":true,\"isCode\":false,\"isItalic\":false,\"isStrikethrough\":false,\"range\":[0,23]}],\"decorationStyles\":{},\"decorations\":{},\"indentationLevel\":0,\"listStyle\":\"none\",\"textStyle\":\"pageRegular\"}","pluginData":"","stamp":"4190B572-990B-4A8F-B941-3900523DC33C"},{"isFetched":true,"updated":1777869223116.0623,"type":"text","pluginData":"","documentId":"CC35E3A9-2026-426C-A9CE-71F92FD5C564","blocks":[],"rawProperties":"{\"hasBeenPagifiedBefore\":\"1\"}","style":"{\"_runAttributes\":[{\"isBold\":true,\"range\":[0,25]},{\"isBold\":true,\"range\":[274,14]}],\"decorationStyles\":{},\"decorations\":{},\"indentationLevel\":0,\"listStyle\":\"none\",\"textStyle\":\"body\"}","isInserted":false,"stamp":"AB4EA231-1375-46CA-87B3-BC8F6926D830","content":"2. Build your spreadsheet\nIf you are starting with existing data, you should structure it in a supported platform like Google Sheets, Microsoft Excel, or Smartsheet [5, 6]. Every defined entity must have its own dedicated worksheet, where the properties are laid out as the column headers [5, 7].","modifiedByUserId":"a32da3dc-7552-ed01-a894-e2d81fe1d89c","pageStyleData":"","originalType":"BlockDataModel","pageStyleProps":"{}","id":"1B835350-CCA8-4C40-A954-02BA09752765","created":1777869223116.0239,"isDeleted":false,"createdByUserId":"a32da3dc-7552-ed01-a894-e2d81fe1d89c"},{"stamp":"78AED567-C0E0-407D-8C91-7AD0B9004517","createdByUserId":"a32da3dc-7552-ed01-a894-e2d81fe1d89c","rawProperties":"{\"hasBeenPagifiedBefore\":\"1\"}","style":"{\"_runAttributes\":[{\"isBold\":true,\"range\":[112,9]},{\"isBold\":true,\"range\":[141,8]},{\"isBold\":true,\"range\":[201,18]}],\"decorationStyles\":{},\"decorations\":{},\"indentationLevel\":0,\"listStyle\":\"none\",\"textStyle\":\"body\"}","type":"text","content":"Alternatively, if you are not starting from an existing spreadsheet, you can create your app by starting with a blank app, using a pre-built template, or describing your idea using natural language to Gemini in AppSheet for an AI-assisted build [2, 6, 8].","pageStyleData":"","isFetched":true,"blocks":[],"updated":1777869223116.229,"modifiedByUserId":"a32da3dc-7552-ed01-a894-e2d81fe1d89c","documentId":"CC35E3A9-2026-426C-A9CE-71F92FD5C564","pageStyleProps":"{}","isDeleted":false,"originalType":"BlockDataModel","pluginData":"","created":1777869223116.1919,"id":"020A9271-79F4-4A17-A41B-5EEBA86E6B85","isInserted":false},{"pageStyleData":"","documentId":"CC35E3A9-2026-426C-A9CE-71F92FD5C564","originalType":"BlockDataModel","isFetched":true,"blocks":["1B835350-CCA8-4C40-A954-02BA09752765","020A9271-79F4-4A17-A41B-5EEBA86E6B85"],"content":"2. Build Your Spreadsheet","created":1777869223116.3301,"rawProperties":"{}","type":"text","stamp":"FA0230DE-7918-4E4F-A68E-2F063EB30ED3","pageStyleProps":"{}","isDeleted":false,"id":"EF70EDC5-46C7-4A7D-94A9-EFF19C3B90BA","style":"{\"_runAttributes\":[],\"decorationStyles\":{},\"decorations\":{},\"indentationLevel\":0,\"listStyle\":\"none\",\"textStyle\":\"pageRegular\"}","modifiedByUserId":"a32da3dc-7552-ed01-a894-e2d81fe1d89c","isInserted":false,"createdByUserId":"a32da3dc-7552-ed01-a894-e2d81fe1d89c","pluginData":"","updated":1777869223116.4829},{"content":"\nTo integrate your data into your app, simply navigate to the Data panel in the AppSheet editor, click +, and select the specific spreadsheet or data tables you want to connect [7].","createdByUserId":"a32da3dc-7552-ed01-a894-e2d81fe1d89c","pageStyleProps":"{}","pluginData":"","isFetched":true,"originalType":"BlockDataModel","rawProperties":"{}","type":"text","pageStyleData":"","updated":1777869223116.6421,"id":"C1B4B1C2-2F4B-4894-9721-9699C01746F0","blocks":[],"created":1777869223116.6069,"style":"{\"_runAttributes\":[{\"isBold\":true,\"isCode\":false,\"isItalic\":false,\"isStrikethrough\":false,\"range\":[62,4]},{\"isBold\":true,\"isCode\":false,\"isItalic\":false,\"isStrikethrough\":false,\"range\":[103,1]}],\"decorationStyles\":{},\"decorations\":{},\"indentationLevel\":0,\"listStyle\":\"none\",\"textStyle\":\"body\"}","modifiedByUserId":"a32da3dc-7552-ed01-a894-e2d81fe1d89c","isInserted":false,"isDeleted":false,"documentId":"CC35E3A9-2026-426C-A9CE-71F92FD5C564","stamp":"978AA6A9-D9EC-43A5-91CB-785CAE0CA53C"},{"updated":1777869223116.8962,"type":"text","content":"3. Plug in your spreadsheet","isDeleted":false,"pageStyleData":"","originalType":"BlockDataModel","blocks":["C1B4B1C2-2F4B-4894-9721-9699C01746F0"],"documentId":"CC35E3A9-2026-426C-A9CE-71F92FD5C564","pluginData":"","created":1777869223116.7478,"rawProperties":"{}","isInserted":false,"stamp":"7CE78A72-A610-411F-A6AA-D87E39C58E92","pageStyleProps":"{}","createdByUserId":"a32da3dc-7552-ed01-a894-e2d81fe1d89c","isFetched":true,"modifiedByUserId":"a32da3dc-7552-ed01-a894-e2d81fe1d89c","style":"{\"_runAttributes\":[{\"isBold\":true,\"isCode\":false,\"isItalic\":false,\"isStrikethrough\":false,\"range\":[0,27]}],\"decorationStyles\":{},\"decorations\":{},\"indentationLevel\":0,\"listStyle\":\"none\",\"textStyle\":\"pageRegular\"}","id":"C261811A-FB38-4AA9-A80B-6F9A7DBEAD33"},{"updated":1777869223117.0249,"modifiedByUserId":"a32da3dc-7552-ed01-a894-e2d81fe1d89c","documentId":"CC35E3A9-2026-426C-A9CE-71F92FD5C564","id":"11420AA4-FB7F-46E8-85F7-B142AE9F19CA","pluginData":"","stamp":"38FBDFC2-049C-467A-9280-78A7A43BDBC7","style":"{\"_runAttributes\":[{\"isBold\":true,\"isCode\":false,\"isItalic\":false,\"isStrikethrough\":false,\"range\":[144,5]},{\"isBold\":true,\"isCode\":false,\"isItalic\":false,\"isStrikethrough\":false,\"range\":[260,10]}],\"decorationStyles\":{},\"decorations\":{},\"indentationLevel\":0,\"listStyle\":\"none\",\"textStyle\":\"body\"}","content":"\nThe UX definition determines what your users see and how they interact with the interface [9, 10]. You visualize data by configuring different Views, such as calendars, maps, detail lists, or dashboards [9]. To capture new information from users, you rely on Form views, which AppSheet automatically generates for any table that permits data additions or updates [11, 12].","type":"text","originalType":"BlockDataModel","isDeleted":false,"isFetched":true,"rawProperties":"{}","pageStyleProps":"{}","pageStyleData":"","createdByUserId":"a32da3dc-7552-ed01-a894-e2d81fe1d89c","isInserted":false,"created":1777869223116.991,"blocks":[]},{"type":"text","blocks":["11420AA4-FB7F-46E8-85F7-B142AE9F19CA"],"isInserted":false,"createdByUserId":"a32da3dc-7552-ed01-a894-e2d81fe1d89c","isDeleted":false,"created":1777869223117.147,"id":"DFC980B0-2D85-47F7-94C6-C56236AAC02F","stamp":"FE04ED7C-9C34-4394-8ACA-73965611F730","documentId":"CC35E3A9-2026-426C-A9CE-71F92FD5C564","pageStyleData":"","rawProperties":"{}","content":"4. Define the user experience (UX)","isFetched":true,"originalType":"BlockDataModel","modifiedByUserId":"a32da3dc-7552-ed01-a894-e2d81fe1d89c","style":"{\"_runAttributes\":[{\"isBold\":true,\"isCode\":false,\"isItalic\":false,\"isStrikethrough\":false,\"range\":[0,34]}],\"decorationStyles\":{},\"decorations\":{},\"indentationLevel\":0,\"listStyle\":\"none\",\"textStyle\":\"pageRegular\"}","pluginData":"","updated":1777869223117.2891,"pageStyleProps":"{}"},{"id":"6C71603C-B82B-4010-B7EA-3B1C33E13D44","style":"{\"_runAttributes\":[],\"decorationStyles\":{},\"decorations\":{},\"indentationLevel\":0,\"listStyle\":\"none\",\"textStyle\":\"body\"}","blocks":[],"pluginData":"","modifiedByUserId":"a32da3dc-7552-ed01-a894-e2d81fe1d89c","createdByUserId":"a32da3dc-7552-ed01-a894-e2d81fe1d89c","updated":1777869223117.4131,"stamp":"6892AE4F-6EDE-4AE4-9182-1D2E39F92CA9","isInserted":false,"pageStyleData":"","type":"text","content":"\nWhile AppSheet provides default capabilities for data syncing and form editing, you can heavily customize your app's functionality [12, 13]. You can refine behavior using four increasingly powerful approaches [14]:","pageStyleProps":"{}","isFetched":true,"created":1777869223117.3789,"rawProperties":"{}","originalType":"BlockDataModel","isDeleted":false,"documentId":"CC35E3A9-2026-426C-A9CE-71F92FD5C564"},{"blocks":[],"createdByUserId":"a32da3dc-7552-ed01-a894-e2d81fe1d89c","pageStyleData":"","rawProperties":"{}","documentId":"CC35E3A9-2026-426C-A9CE-71F92FD5C564","pluginData":"","style":"{\"_runAttributes\":[{\"isBold\":true,\"range\":[0,21]}],\"decorationStyles\":{},\"decorations\":{},\"indentationLevel\":0,\"listStyle\":\"bullet\",\"textStyle\":\"body\"}","originalType":"BlockDataModel","modifiedByUserId":"a32da3dc-7552-ed01-a894-e2d81fe1d89c","id":"50A4C626-AAC5-4BB2-9C7C-A8BC910F21CA","stamp":"3D012C00-2506-4EAC-AE0E-193D79C87FAC","type":"text","isInserted":false,"updated":1777869223117.5488,"content":"Static configuration: Fixed, simple settings applied to all users, such as making a column read-only or defining offline behavior rules [14, 15].","pageStyleProps":"{}","isDeleted":false,"isFetched":true,"created":1777869223117.5142},{"isDeleted":false,"updated":1777869223117.6709,"type":"text","modifiedByUserId":"a32da3dc-7552-ed01-a894-e2d81fe1d89c","blocks":[],"rawProperties":"{}","documentId":"CC35E3A9-2026-426C-A9CE-71F92FD5C564","content":"Dynamic configuration: Creating tailored behaviors using spreadsheet-like expressions (formulas) to dynamically hide columns, format data, or compute virtual columns [15-18].","originalType":"BlockDataModel","pageStyleProps":"{}","pluginData":"","stamp":"E3C8AEB9-F266-471E-91CD-5A9CC60935AF","id":"3C3154E0-0BBB-47A2-B07D-C7CA023F7B10","style":"{\"_runAttributes\":[{\"isBold\":true,\"range\":[0,22]},{\"isBold\":true,\"range\":[74,11]}],\"decorationStyles\":{},\"decorations\":{},\"indentationLevel\":0,\"listStyle\":\"bullet\",\"textStyle\":\"body\"}","created":1777869223117.6372,"pageStyleData":"","isInserted":false,"isFetched":true,"createdByUserId":"a32da3dc-7552-ed01-a894-e2d81fe1d89c"},{"pageStyleProps":"{}","modifiedByUserId":"a32da3dc-7552-ed01-a894-e2d81fe1d89c","documentId":"CC35E3A9-2026-426C-A9CE-71F92FD5C564","blocks":[],"createdByUserId":"a32da3dc-7552-ed01-a894-e2d81fe1d89c","id":"B4FE4549-E40F-481A-A264-D819E6E9A870","type":"text","style":"{\"_runAttributes\":[{\"isBold\":true,\"range\":[0,8]}],\"decorationStyles\":{},\"decorations\":{},\"indentationLevel\":0,\"listStyle\":\"bullet\",\"textStyle\":\"body\"}","pageStyleData":"","isInserted":false,"stamp":"6E60158E-8529-40D0-8D2C-7A4CB8EB6C50","updated":1777869223117.793,"isDeleted":false,"created":1777869223117.759,"originalType":"BlockDataModel","content":"Actions: Custom buttons and operations that execute specific logical steps for the user, such as updating a record's status, navigating to a different view, or opening an external application [13, 19].","pluginData":"","isFetched":true,"rawProperties":"{}"},{"pageStyleData":"","documentId":"CC35E3A9-2026-426C-A9CE-71F92FD5C564","content":"Automation: Using bots to trigger complex tasks behind the scenes—like sending emails, creating push notifications, or parsing documents—based on data changes or recurring time schedules [20-22].","stamp":"0CD8B95F-41CC-4A97-8920-CB5338796A6C","isInserted":false,"rawProperties":"{}","pluginData":"","style":"{\"_runAttributes\":[{\"isBold\":true,\"range\":[0,11]},{\"isItalic\":true,\"range\":[18,4]}],\"decorationStyles\":{},\"decorations\":{},\"indentationLevel\":0,\"listStyle\":\"bullet\",\"textStyle\":\"body\"}","pageStyleProps":"{}","id":"F0125463-7072-4A0C-AC96-EA1EBE006187","modifiedByUserId":"a32da3dc-7552-ed01-a894-e2d81fe1d89c","type":"text","created":1777869223117.8821,"updated":1777869223117.916,"createdByUserId":"a32da3dc-7552-ed01-a894-e2d81fe1d89c","originalType":"BlockDataModel","isFetched":true,"blocks":[],"isDeleted":false},{"id":"6FDF5BCC-9932-47BA-8CD4-2E4F32E98AAD","isFetched":true,"type":"text","isDeleted":false,"pluginData":"","content":"5. Refine the app behavior","pageStyleData":"","modifiedByUserId":"a32da3dc-7552-ed01-a894-e2d81fe1d89c","pageStyleProps":"{}","style":"{\"_runAttributes\":[{\"isBold\":true,\"isCode\":false,\"isItalic\":false,\"isStrikethrough\":false,\"range\":[0,26]}],\"decorationStyles\":{},\"decorations\":{},\"indentationLevel\":0,\"listStyle\":\"none\",\"textStyle\":\"pageRegular\"}","originalType":"BlockDataModel","rawProperties":"{}","createdByUserId":"a32da3dc-7552-ed01-a894-e2d81fe1d89c","isInserted":false,"documentId":"CC35E3A9-2026-426C-A9CE-71F92FD5C564","updated":1777869223118.186,"created":1777869223118.0181,"blocks":["6C71603C-B82B-4010-B7EA-3B1C33E13D44","50A4C626-AAC5-4BB2-9C7C-A8BC910F21CA","3C3154E0-0BBB-47A2-B07D-C7CA023F7B10","B4FE4549-E40F-481A-A264-D819E6E9A870","F0125463-7072-4A0C-AC96-EA1EBE006187"],"stamp":"D5D6B514-6718-4710-BCDA-9E978AF5A652"},{"documentId":"CC35E3A9-2026-426C-A9CE-71F92FD5C564","originalType":"BlockDataModel","id":"854D063D-7F61-48FF-8492-1195BB3CAD6A","isInserted":false,"rawProperties":"{}","createdByUserId":"a32da3dc-7552-ed01-a894-e2d81fe1d89c","pageStyleProps":"{}","pluginData":"","type":"text","blocks":[],"modifiedByUserId":"a32da3dc-7552-ed01-a894-e2d81fe1d89c","updated":1777869223118.3911,"created":1777869223118.3528,"style":"{\"_runAttributes\":[],\"decorationStyles\":{},\"decorations\":{},\"indentationLevel\":0,\"listStyle\":\"none\",\"textStyle\":\"body\"}","content":"\nBefore distributing your app, you must secure it [23]. In most business environments, you will restrict access by requiring users to sign in and explicitly whitelisting their email addresses [24, 25]. You can also apply dynamic row-level security filters so that different users only see the data specifically relevant to them [26]. Once secured and shared, you can utilize AppSheet's management tools to track app performance, collaborate with your team, manage version control, and troubleshoot errors as you continue to iterate on your design [1, 27].","pageStyleData":"","stamp":"15DB9D19-BF55-4341-AF5B-70C26FAED9E7","isFetched":true,"isDeleted":false},{"modifiedByUserId":"a32da3dc-7552-ed01-a894-e2d81fe1d89c","isDeleted":false,"stamp":"B77E779D-B542-4AFE-937C-FDB87C7E81A8","blocks":["854D063D-7F61-48FF-8492-1195BB3CAD6A"],"isFetched":true,"createdByUserId":"a32da3dc-7552-ed01-a894-e2d81fe1d89c","updated":1777869223118.665,"style":"{\"_runAttributes\":[{\"isBold\":true,\"isCode\":false,\"isItalic\":false,\"isStrikethrough\":false,\"range\":[0,41]}],\"decorationStyles\":{},\"decorations\":{},\"indentationLevel\":0,\"listStyle\":\"none\",\"textStyle\":\"pageRegular\"}","documentId":"CC35E3A9-2026-426C-A9CE-71F92FD5C564","rawProperties":"{}","created":1777869223118.52,"pluginData":"","id":"00A7A1BE-D4B9-4463-BC9F-FFFF7542EC0E","content":"6. Review app security, share, and manage","originalType":"BlockDataModel","isInserted":false,"type":"text","pageStyleData":"","pageStyleProps":"{}"},{"isFetched":true,"pageStyleData":"","updated":1777869223118.9871,"modifiedByUserId":"a32da3dc-7552-ed01-a894-e2d81fe1d89c","pageStyleProps":"{\"backdrop\":\"image(\\\"https%3A%2F%2Fres.craft.do%2Fuserprofile%2Fa32da3dc-7552-ed01-a894-e2d81fe1d89c%2Fstylepreset%2Fstyle_B2845B1D-9A47-4F01-BCD9-2027A2A3D581%2Febf7bbd1-cbf0-7de2-2784-93e09bc80705%2F1czgLMakHyecDmoUvrQ1KXwf83Gh0c0YQaSmOCUlHAEz\\\", \\\"@85%7DKoju0ME3bF%250s*juWGNaf8xZE3a%7B-m%252jbNGM%7CbGt7$%7BbFIuS$jbs9\\\", \\\"assetId::953D79BE-7105-4DED-9ED2-3C6F84E01E8B\\\")\",\"background-color\":\"#000000 #000000\",\"card-assets\":\"image(\\\"https%3A%2F%2Fres.craft.do%2Fassets%2Ftheme%2Fcards%2Finfinity-void-card-1.jpeg\\\")|image(\\\"https%3A%2F%2Fres.craft.do%2Fassets%2Ftheme%2Fcards%2Finfinity-void-card-2.jpeg\\\")|image(\\\"https%3A%2F%2Fres.craft.do%2Fassets%2Ftheme%2Fcards%2Finfinity-void-card-3.jpeg\\\")|image(\\\"https%3A%2F%2Fres.craft.do%2Fassets%2Ftheme%2Fcards%2Finfinity-void-card-4.jpeg\\\")|image